before for dinner party and pretty much any episode featuring Michael's Condo.

142
00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:56.540
It was in Reseda, California, and it was owned now by a married couple.

143
00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:02.600
In order to use their condo, we had to move them into a hotel for an entire week.

144
00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:03.220
Okay.

145
00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.800
We had to take all of their stuff out.

146
00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.120
They put it into cartons in the garage.

147
00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.120
We painted the entire downstairs and decorated it.

148
00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:18.080
They made a point to decorate it differently from dinner party because, you know, now Michael

149
00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:18.680
is single.

150
00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.400
Yes.

151
00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.860
I noticed the only thing that remained that I recognized from dinner party was the St.

152
00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.160
Pauly girl beer sign.

153
00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:25.940
Same.

154
00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:27.200
In the dining room.

155
00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:27.620
Yes.

156
