So it'd be like kitchen counter.

164
00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.080
Yes.

165
00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:57.380
Yeah.

166
00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:02.500
So that when the people came back, like even their little spoon caddy was where they left

167
00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.640
it, or if they had a bookshelf, all their stuff, the books were in the same order as

168
00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:06.820
before.

169
00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.620
