191
00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:15.560
Tell me everything.

192
00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:22.400
Well, I looked into this woman, and performance had been a part of her life her whole life.

193
00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.200
She had done vaudeville.

194
00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.940
She had performed live with Frank Sinatra.

195
00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:31.640
But it's true that she never had a film or television role until she was 40.

196
00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:36.680
So on the commentary the writers were talking about her on set, they said she had the most

197
00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.820
