198
00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:41.340
She was throwing out stories about Bing Crosby, Bob Hope.

199
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.920
They were just like, oh my gosh.

200
00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.940
She was fascinating.

201
00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:48.480
What I love about her story, Jenna, is that she did stage shows for years.

202
00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.120
She didn't get an on-camera role till 40.

203
00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.420
But this was her passion.

204
00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:54.740
And you should never let anyone take that away from you.

205
00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:58.880
However your passion manifests itself, I just love her story.

206
00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.260
She just kept at it.

207
00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:05.900
She has over 140 acting credits, and almost all of them are small roles.

208
00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.700
And she has this quote about her acting career where she said,

209
00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.220
Life is fun.

210
00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.800
That has nothing to do with whether you become a star or not.

211
00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.380
And if the parts aren't too large, I can go around talking to everybody.

212
00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.280
It's like going to a party.

213
00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.180
Aw.

214
00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:28.940
And when she was 104, she wrote an autobiography called, I Never Wanted to Be a Star, and I

215
00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:29.460
Wasn't.

