222
00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.280
Well, I remember her from when Harry met Sally.

223
00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:52.520
She is one of the women in the couples that they interview documentary style.

224
00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:53.060
Yes!

225
00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.400
She has no lines.

226
00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.480
